WEBVTT

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.910
<i>Is there anyone who has no secrets?</i>

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>I'm too scared to say it.</i>

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>I'm afraid something will break</i>

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.020
<i>if I say it.</i>

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>But I really</i>

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.950
<i>want her to know.</i>

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.340
<i>She should be</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.260
<i>alone in the classroom right now.</i>

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.420
Okay.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.510
<i>I have nothing</i>

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:15.670
<i>to lose, anyway.</i>

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.940
<i>So go, Kuromine Asahi!</i>

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.960
<b>I'll Confess!</b>

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.080
I'll Confess!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.760
I'm not the same man I used to be.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.260
You're not going to read me.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:25.260
Not so long as I have these fashion glasses!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.440
This one, then.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.100
Yay!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.150
How?!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.430
I always feel like I'm doing

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.530
something sacrilegious when 
I play Old Maid with you, Asahi.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.460
Seriously.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.160
You're such a leaky basket, Asahi.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.810
"Leaky basket" doesn't even make sense!

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.040
Baskets are supposed to be leaky!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.300
Nah,

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.960
you're a leaky basket because 
you're even more full of holes.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.470
<i>I, Kuromine Asahi...</i>

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.220
<b>No running in the hallway!</b>

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.220
What do you think of this poster now?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.700
I think it's good.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.470
All right, I'll redo it!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.580
So I'm gonna just go for it and...

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.200
Oh, sorry, this is just between us.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:23.400
<b>Secrets</b>

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:23.590
<b>Lies</b>

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:23.590
<b>Truth</b>

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:20.900
<i>...can, sadly, neither lie nor keep secrets.</i>

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.780
<i>So they call me "a leaky basket."</i>

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.370
But, come on,

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.370
you guys could trust me a little more.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.540
Well, I don't know about trust,

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.080
but I do believe you.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.360
Oka...

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.430
It's not a bad thing that 
you can't keep secrets.

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:39.290
Shima...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.800
Yeah, only because it's you, Asahi.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.940
Sakura-san...

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.660
You're just saying this for kicks, aren't you?

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.890
<i>You're so obvious.</i>

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.770
<i>Sorry, friends.</i>

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.780
<i>I'm actually really glad you feel that way.</i>

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:03.110
<i>But even I have a secret of my own.</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.650
Okay, to translate this...

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:09.010
<i>A secret that I've kept from fall of first year</i>

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.440
<i>all the way to April of second year.</i>

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:12.400
Shiragami.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:13.940
Yes.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.710
<i>Actually, I,</i>

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.420
<i>Kuromine Asahi,</i>

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:28.680
<i>like this girl, Shiragami Youko.</i>

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:37.560
<i>She's sort of... mysterious.</i>

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.820
<i>She seems to arrive at school 
earlier than anyone else.</i>

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.320
<i>She's always alone during breaks.</i>

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:47.920
Hey, Shiragami-san, can I see your notes?

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:49.780
Sure.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.870
<i>And for no apparent reason,</i>

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.040
<i>she seems to go home later than everyone.</i>

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.290
<i>Come to think of it, 
maybe it's only natural that I,</i>

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.960
<i>being incapable of keeping secrets,</i>

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.210
<i>became attracted to my polar opposite.</i>

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.840
Okay, you can sit down now.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.120
Okay.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:18.590
What the heck, Asahi?!

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:21.620
I, uh, don't know the answer 
to the next question...

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.150
Calm down! I don't know it, either!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.700
<i>Crap, we totally made eye contact!</i>

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.410
<i>I wonder if she noticed me looking.</i>

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.270
Okay, Kuromine, you answer the next one.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.270
<i>If she found out from that...</i>

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.880
<i>No!</i>

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.790
Hey, Kuromine!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.210
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.880
<i>I have to keep this secret!</i>

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.030
Hey, Kuromine!

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:41.010
You can't keep quiet, and 
now you won't answer me?!

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.540
Sensei, calm down, please!

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:46.590
Koumoto-sensei, I'd like you 
to continue the lesson.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.340
Kuromine Asahi, you will 
focus on class, as well.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:52.290
R-Right.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.140
Sorry, class rep.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.390
You'd better watch it.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.390
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:01.900
Okay, next, let's see...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.400
So anyway...

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.280
That was bad.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.400
Asahi.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.010
Let's go eat.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:12.870
Sure.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.740
Shiragami-san.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.500
Want to have lunch with us?

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.120
Sorry, but I have something to do.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.040
Don't worry about it.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.280
Next time, okay?

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:31.300
One, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven, eight...

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.680
There!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:29.710
Ow, ow!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.300
I can't go any further!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.680
Nice, nice.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.100
Hot, huh, Asahi?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.330
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:41.770
<i>Shiragami always sits out 
when we have P.E. outside.</i>

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.980
<i>I thought she had sensitive skin,</i>

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.610
<i>but I saw her really tan one time.</i>

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.840
<i>Why does she—</i>

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.980
What are you looking at, Eromine?!

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.990
Today was awful.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.770
You had it coming.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.830
I told you, it wasn't like that.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:02.620
So,

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.710
when are you going to 
confess to Shiragami-san?

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:08.780
How do you—

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.710
I mean, what are you talking about?!

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.490
He thought he was hiding it.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.430
It's obvious you've been looking at her.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.880
I might have messed up today, yeah.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.690
But you didn't know until now, did you?

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.560
For a long time now, I've...

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.700
Since last fall, right?

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.820
It's been a while, huh?

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:33.610
No way...

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.780
You guys...

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.700
You knew?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.540
Sorry for not telling you.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.470
I was kind of embarrassed.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.040
I never really planned to tell her or anything,

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.300
so I figured I'd just keep it quiet.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.290
Hey, come on.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.330
Everyone has a secret or two.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.080
Exactly.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:59.100
It's not a bad thing, having a secret love.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.340
Guys...

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.730
Nope, it's no good at all.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.310
In fact, it won't work.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.480
After all, you're a basket full of holes.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.110
A leaky basket!

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.150
Have you forgotten, Asahi?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.950
The humiliation you were forced to endure 
by the class rep— nay, the Iron Lady?

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.450
The tragedy of last summer?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.160
Kuromine Asahi, I'll get right to the point.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:28.670
If you wouldn't mind, I'd like 
you to stop staring at me.

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:31.460
I'm completely uninterested in you.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:37.470
It's irrational of you to continue pursuing 
a battle you have no chance of winning.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.510
I haven't even confessed to you or anything!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.940
Someone, get a towel, quick!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.470
Stop the match!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.690
That was brutal.

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:44.640
To think his inability to keep 
secrets would create such a tragedy.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.810
Think about it, Asahi.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.310
A normal confession is nothing

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:53.690
compared to that bullet in the back.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.660
No more getting shot in the back.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.030
Confess before you get rejected!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.410
<b>Kill before you're killed</b>

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.410
<i>Confess before I get rejected!</i>

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.050
That's right, Asahi.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:05.160
Go confess.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:10.960
But I can't confess.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.840
Then are you going to give up?

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.920
No way!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.210
I can't give up!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.850
Then go, Asahi.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.140
We put you up to it, 
so we'll comfort you when it's over.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.040
Guys...

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:34.610
In other words, you all think I'm 
going to get rejected, don't you?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.160
But still,

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:39.860
thanks.

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:42.320
All right, I'm going.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.360
But Shiragami-san, huh?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:49.070
She's pretty, but...

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.190
Out of his league.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:52.610
She seems pretty unapproachable.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.930
Haven't you guys noticed?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.710
Shiragami-san's been stealing 
looks at Asahi sometimes.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.090
I think he has a chance.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.930
Seriously?

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:17.850
Okay.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:24.410
Shiragami Youko-sama

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.310
<i>I'll give her this love letter,</i>

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.410
<i>and run as fast as I can.</i>

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.710
<i>I have nothing</i>

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.250
<i>to lose, anyway.</i>

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.380
<i>So go, Kuromine Asahi!</i>

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.680
Nothing beats spreading my 
wings in an empty classroom.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.960
<b>How heartwarming.        I can hear your entire love letter.                                 I-I've always...</b>

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.280
<i>W-Wings?!</i>

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:22.720
<i>She retracted them!</i>

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.330
<i>F-Fangs?!</i>

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.390
<i>She hid them!</i>

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.810
<i>Does this mean...</i>

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:39.610
Did you see?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.020
Did you?

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.960
U-Um, I... I didn't.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.600
Y-You're lying.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.590
No, I swear, I swear.

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.750
I wasn't watching you today, either.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:01.330
You saw it! I can see it in your face!

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.330
He's taking a while.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:09.550
I wonder if his confession went okay.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.780
Maybe he already got rejected,

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.810
and he's off crying his eyes out somewhere.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:17.690
Well, y'know, worrying won't do any good.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.970
Let's go see him.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:22.690
Oh? What about Asahi?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:23.940
You!

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:25.070
The heathen queen!

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:28.610
Journalism Club president, Akemi Mikan!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.950
You all look like idiots, as always.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:35.040
Oh, I'm a huge fan of the school newspaper!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.750
Will you stop that?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.750
It kills all the fun when you enjoy it.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:40.790
That's so harsh.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.840
Why are you here, anyway?

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:46.550
I've been looking for a good story.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.330
Where is he?

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.090
Tell me where Asahi went.

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:53.730
And if I said "no"?

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.440
Who do you think I am?

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.040
"Don't do it" means "do it."

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.820
"It's a secret" means "find out."

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.570
I'm Akemi Mikan, and that's my motto!

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.220
That's the heathen queen for you.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.960
She's hardcore.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:11.780
In that case...

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.350
Run!

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:13.870
Wait!

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:15.540
You guys!

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.910
I've been keeping it a secret, but...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.050
Actually, I, Shiragami Youko,

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:30.050
am a vampire.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.800
A vampire?

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.780
I'm such an idiot!

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:40.800
Why couldn't I wait until I got home 
before I spread my wings?

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:45.060
So, uh, you normally speak 
in the Kansai dialect, huh?

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:49.860
I tend to get complacent and show 
my fangs when I'm speaking normally,

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:53.570
so I make it a point to talk politely 
and avoid talking to people.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:57.940
V-Vampires turn to ash when they're
exposed to sunlight, right?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.000
Is that why for P.E. and 
going to and from school...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.610
No, I don't turn to ash.

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.880
I just tan really easily.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.550
<i>So that's what it was!</i>

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.550
<i>Goodbye, mysterious Shiragami!</i>

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:15.850
So you aren't afraid of me, Kuromine-kun?

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.430
Because I'm, well...

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.020
a vampire?

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.610
No, in fact, it's really cute.

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.430
What?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.780
<i>What the hell am I saying?</i>

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:35.450
Um, you don't have it confused 
with something else, do you?

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.740
Wait, do you not know what a vampire is?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.700
I thought it was common knowledge.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:44.670
<i>Huh? She hasn't noticed I have feelings for her?</i>

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.550
<i>Could it be that Shiragami's...</i>

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.650
<i>really dense?</i>

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:52.740
Oh, sorry. I've been rambling.

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:56.470
But, well, I mean...

00:15:56.740 --> 00:16:01.140
I'm glad you're the last 
one I was able to talk to.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.070
Now that I've been outed as a vampire,

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:08.730
I have to leave this school.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.990
That's the condition my dad gave me.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.120
<i>Did I just screw up?</i>

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:18.920
Um—

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:24.040
Honestly, I thought I was prepared for 
someone to find out eventually.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:29.630
But I thought whoever found out 
would be scared to death.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:33.380
I thought it would end a lot worse.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.090
So, well...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.640
Thanks a lot, Kuromine-kun.

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:42.720
<i>How?</i>

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:46.110
<i>How can you smile like that, Shiragami?</i>

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.360
<i>I mean, it's my fault that...</i>

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.350
Sorry, did I say something weird?

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:58.360
I-It's not!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.370
It's not your fault!

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:02.540
<i>No.</i>

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.800
<i>Shiragami can't quit school now.</i>

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.170
<i>I don't want that.</i>

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:11.400
<i>She's been happily chattering 
in her Kansai dialect,</i>

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.740
<i>switching from one expression to another.</i>

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:19.350
<i>I think she actually likes talking to people a lot.</i>

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:21.320
<i>Yet,</i>

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.120
<i>in order for her</i>

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.600
<i>to keep just one secret...</i>

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.210
Hey, it's all right.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.740
Look, I'm fine, see?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.870
I had enough fun being a student.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.330
<i>Enough fun?</i>

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.680
So I'm fine, see?

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.590
No.

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:56.220
I can't allow it!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.220
Kuromine-kun?

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:02.510
Look, I don't want you to just quit school now.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.270
What am I talking about?

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.020
I mean, um, you know...

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.230
That's it!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.980
You can keep it a secret 
that your secret got out.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.520
Yeah. That's it.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.400
Then you won't have to quit school.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:20.540
I'm, well... really easy to 
see through, apparently.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.910
People always tell me I'm bad 
at lying and keeping secrets.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.550
But this one...

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.160
Just this one secret...

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.540
I swear I'll keep this secret, no matter what!

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.550
So Shiragami Youko-san, please...

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:35.000
Please...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.880
Let's be friends!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.300
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:43.920
<i>Friends?</i>

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.940
<i>What the hell am I doing?!</i>

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.030
Bring it on, leaky basket.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.160
Take that!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.690
I barely feel a thing.

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.660
Friends?

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:10.330
Uh, that is... I mean...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.850
Did I say something weird?

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.220
Kuromine-kun,

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.130
well...

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.140
if I'm good enough...

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:27.860
I'd be glad to.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:39.360
<i>And so I, Kuromine Asahi, the leaky 
basket who can't lie or keep secrets,</i>

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:43.130
<i>now have a secret that
I absolutely must keep to myself.</i>

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:20.170
You have to wait until this 
late to go home, huh?

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:25.440
Well, I can't come to school tan every day.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.090
That's true.

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:32.450
Speaking of which, you never 
noticed I was a vampire, did you?

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:35.640
No, I found out just today.

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:39.650
So I <i>was</i> being too self-conscious.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.520
About what?

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:45.860
Well, I mean, I had the sense that 
you were looking at me a lot.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:52.440
So I thought maybe you'd 
noticed I was a vampire.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:55.660
L-Let's just say that's a secret.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:57.940
S-Secret?

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:00.960
Did I have a nose hair 
sticking out or something?

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.670
Absolutely not!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:05.900
I'm kind of glad.

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:11.270
You said you had other secrets, 
so you kind of scared me.

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:12.960
Sorry.

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:18.500
<i>Yeah, I did have another secret.</i>

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:23.200
<i>I'll take this secret to the grave,</i>

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:25.440
<i>to protect Shiragami.</i>

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.570
Listen, Shiragami-san...

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:33.410
I'll tell you my secret someday.

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:36.190
Hear me out when the time comes.

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:37.380
What's this about?

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:40.840
It's kind of scary when you 
make such a big deal out of it.

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:53.030
Communication systems online.

00:22:54.590 --> 00:22:57.280
Code Number 138 here.

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.270
Operation proceeding without issue.

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:01.600
I am returning to regular duties.

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:05.940
Life signs from one o'clock?

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:12.990
It's...

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:15.990
Kuromine Asahi and Shiragami Youko.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:18.860
Why are they here so late?

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.420
<b>Actually I Am Quiz!</b>

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.420
<b>Can you guess?</b>

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:23.500
Time for the <i>Actually I Am</i> Quiz!

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:24.420
Why now?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:26.240
Whose silhouette is this?

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:27.360
You're not answering me?

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:28.360
Any hints?

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:31.530
The script says it's Kuromine-kun's crush.

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:33.540
Stop the quiz!

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:34.880
What are you doing, Kuromine-kun?!

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:36.310
I can't see with your hand in the way!

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.050
You don't have to see it!

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.330
I'm moving your hand!

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:41.060
Don't look, Shiragami!

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:42.740
Don't get the wrong idea, Eromine.

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:45.070
What the hell, Shima?!

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:48.040
You're really close to your 
friends, huh, Kuromine-kun?

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:50.950
<b>Next Episode:
"I'll Keep This Secret!"</b>

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:50.680
Can we not do this segment anymore?
